## Summary of Active Services

The project currently **actively uses** these external services:
1. **PostgreSQL** — database (Aiven in prod, local in dev)
2. **Gmail SMTP** — email delivery
3. **Backblaze B2** — file/object storage (via AWS S3 SDK)

**Inactive/optional** (dependencies present but commented out in config): **MySQL**, **Cloudinary**, and **Cloudflare R2** (referenced in commented config in [`application-prod.properties`](src/main/resources/application-prod.properties:46)).

The file storage layer is abstracted through [`FileStorageService`](src/main/java/com/my_hourly/common/service/FileStorageService.java) and [`FileStorageServiceB2`](src/main/java/com/my_hourly/common/service/FileStorageServiceB2.java), with two implementations — [`B2FileStorageServiceImpl`](src/main/java/com/my_hourly/common/service/impl/B2FileStorageServiceImpl.java) (active) and [`CloudinaryFileStorageServiceImpl`](src/main/java/com/my_hourly/common/service/impl/CloudinaryFileStorageServiceImpl.java) (available but not currently configured).